% visidata

# Open a CSV file
visidata <file.csv>

# Open a TSV file
visidata <file.tsv>

# Open a JSON file
visidata <file.json>

# Open an Excel file
visidata <file.xlsx>

# Open multiple files (merge sheets)
visidata <file1.csv> <file2.csv>

# Key: Quit / Close
# Key: Open command line
# Key: Sort ascending on column
# Key: Sort descending on column
# Key: Select rows matching expression
# Key: Unselect all rows
# Key: Delete selected rows
# Key: Copy selected cells
# Key: Open new sheet from selected rows
# Key: Set column type
Key: <expr> - evaluate Python expression on data